<title>HONG KONG: Peregrine sets warrants on Hutchison.</title>
<headline>Peregrine sets warrants on Hutchison.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd has issued 100 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hutchison Whampoa Ltd, a Peregrine official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$67.38	PREMIUM	21.6 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.71	 GEARING	8.6X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	 30.DEC.97     PAYDATE	2 WKS AFTER LAUNCH</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG     MIN EXER LOT 10,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$61.25</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
